@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Relationship notation and multiplicity
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ResumeDraft
class ConfirmedSelection <<value>>
class PublishedResumeRevision
class ReviewSet <<illustrative grouping only>>
ResumeDraft "1" *-- "1" ConfirmedSelection : owned value
ResumeDraft "1" -- "0..*" PublishedResumeRevision : publication provenance
ReviewSet "0..*" o-- "0..*" PublishedResumeRevision : non-owning grouping example

@enduml
